  songTitle: "CANON IN D"
  source: "Pachelbel, Canon in D (c. 1680), upper line over the D-A-Bm-F#m-G-D-G-A ground: the famous line, the second line, the eighth-note variation, the famous line. Works as a canon against itself at 8 beats. Public domain worldwide. Notes: F#5 E5 D5 C#5 B4 A4 B4 C#5 D5 C#5 B4 A4 G4 F#4 G4 E4 D5 F#5 A5 G5 F#5 D5 F#5 E5 D5 B4 D5 A4 G4 B4 A4 G4 F#5 E5 D5 C#5 B4 A4 B4 C#5"
